ed figures).","cites":["ROP.buybacks.2025","ROP.dividends.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $2.2 billion, up 7.6% from $2 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["ROP.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","ROP.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $8.4 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $2.4 billion and net income to $2.6 billion.","cites":["ROP.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ROP.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ROP.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ROP.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","ROP.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","ROP.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ROP.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ROP.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ROP.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","ROP.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","ROP.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ROP.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ROP.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ROP.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","ROP.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $5.2 billion at the end of FY2025, against $4.8 billion a year earlier. That is 65.9% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["ROP.rpo.2025","ROP.rpo.2024","ROP.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.9 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $1.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["ROP.deferred.2025","ROP.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 19,400 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $407,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ROP.q.employees","ROP.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $297 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $9.3 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Debt less cash was $9 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["ROP.cash.2025","ROP.debtLong.2025","ROP.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"ROP":{}},"quotes":{"ROP.q.employees":{"c":"ROP","kind":"employees","n":19400,"quote":"As of December 31, 2025, we employed approximately 19,400 people worldwide on a consolidated basis, of which approximately 13,100 were employed in the U.S. and approximately 6,300 were employed outside of the U.S.","source":"ROP-0000882835-26-000009","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"068dc608c2fdf916cdd3b21fefc06d32d61535bc3dbf9e91043a085fb317a020"}}}